/*-check.png
/wander-inline-edit-release.png
/ol-*.png
*.tsbuildinfo

# tauri
src-tauri/Cargo.lock

# lockfiles - keep pnpm-lock.yaml; track Cargo.lock at project root only if needed later
# (currently only pnpm-lock.yaml is committed)
.gstack/

# local Playwright / runtime captures (regenerated every debug session)
.pw-*.png
.dsh/

# catch-all: ignore every root dot-directory (local tooling state).
# The only root dot-directory we DON'T ignore is .github (workflows,
# templates, dependabot config, etc.). Add future dot-directories by
# listing them above this block if they need to be tracked; otherwise
# they'll be silently absorbed by the rule below.
/.*/
/.github/

# stray one-off icon exports left in repo root by the Windows icon tooling
/icon-*.png
